What is SRE?
SRE stands for Site Reliability Engineer. Site Reliability is a discipline that applies Software Engineer principle to IT operation.
It help us to make application and infrastructure reliable, scalable and highly available.
In simple terms:
Developers build the application and SRE engineer ensure that it runs reliably in production.

